        "id": 33920
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T08:09:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The processing logic for obtaining and validating OAuth2.0 Access Tokens is consistent with the Application credential.\nThe difference is that when providing an OAuth 2.0 Access Token API, keystonemiddleware authentication, the request header must specify the Authorization field containing OAuth2.0 Access Token information.",
      "parentUuid": "262fdbb9_8816d8cf",
      "revId": "3fec3b863e144573dc4d9c17b541cf606d271561",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
